***REMOVED*** Data Importer Configuration Example
***REMOVED*** Copy this file to .env or .env.local and modify as needed

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** API KEYS AND CREDENTIALS
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

***REMOVED*** TMDB API (The Movie Database)
TMDB_ACCESS_TOKEN=your_tmdb_access_token_here

***REMOVED*** OMDB API (Open Movie Database)
OMDB_API_KEY=your_omdb_api_key_here

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** PATHS AND DIRECTORIES
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

***REMOVED*** Directory for configuration files
CONFIG_DIR=config

***REMOVED*** Directory for log files
LOGS_DIR=logs

***REMOVED*** Directory for downloaded data
DATA_DIR=data

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** LOGGING SETTINGS
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

***REMOVED*** Log level: DEBUG, INFO, WARNING, ERROR, CRITICAL
LOG_LEVEL=INFO

***REMOVED*** More detailed console output
VERBOSE=false

***REMOVED*** Minimize console output (overrides VERBOSE)
QUIET=false

***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** MOVIE SYNC CONFIGURATION
***REMOVED*** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

***REMOVED*** Year range to sync movies from
MOVIE_SYNC_START_YEAR=1990
MOVIE_SYNC_END_YEAR=2023  ***REMOVED*** Current year will be used if not specified

***REMOVED*** Number of movies to sync per year
MOVIE_SYNC_LIMIT_PER_YEAR=100

***REMOVED*** Minimum vote count for movies to include
MOVIE_SYNC_MIN_VOTE_COUNT=100

***REMOVED*** How to sort movies: popularity.desc or vote_count.desc
MOVIE_SYNC_SORT_BY=vote_count.desc

***REMOVED*** Whether to include cast and crew information
MOVIE_SYNC_INCLUDE_CREDITS=true

***REMOVED*** Whether to include video/trailer information
MOVIE_SYNC_INCLUDE_VIDEOS=true

***REMOVED*** Whether to save movies to the database
MOVIE_SYNC_SAVE_TO_DB=true 